<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lab Overview</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="~/Labs.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>🌐 Lab 2 Overview</h1>
        </header>
        <section class="prerequisites">
            <h2>📌 Prerequisites</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Basic knowledge of network components (PCs, switches, routers)</li>
                <li>Familiarity with IP addressing and subnetting</li>
                <li>GNS3 installed and functioning on your system</li>
                <li>Comfortable using CLI to configure devices</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="description">
            <h2>🔍 Lab Description</h2>
            <p>In this lab, you'll explore the world of Virtual LANs (VLANs)</p>
            <li>✅ Build a network with a switch, router, and four PCs</li>
            <li>✅ Create and assign VLANs to specific switch ports</li>
            <li>✅ Configure subinterfaces on the router for inter-VLAN communication</li>
            <li>✅ Assign IP addresses and test connectivity within and across VLANs</li>
        </section>
        <section class="objectives">
            <h2>🎯 Learning Objectives</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Learn how to segment a network using VLANs</li>
                <li>Configure trunking between a switch and a router</li>
                <li>Enable communication between devices across VLANs</li>
                <li>Test VLAN isolation and inter-VLAN routing</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <div class="actions">
            <button class="launch-btn"><a href="~/GNS3/Lab" style="text-decoration: none; color: white;">🚀 Start Lab</a></button>
        </div>

        <section class="setup">
            <a href="@Url.Action("LoadSetup", "Lab", new {labname = "BLab2"})" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">🛠️ Lab Setup: VLAN Configuration Mastery in GNS3</a>
        </section>

        <section class="resources">
            <h2>📚 Supplementary Resources</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/computer-network-tutorials/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Networking Guide</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.cisa.gov/topics/cybersecurity-best-practices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Security Best Practices</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://docs.gns3.com/docs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GNS3 Documentation</a></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <div class="actions">
            <button class="launch-btn"><a href="~/home/levels" style="text-decoration: none; color: white;">Levels Selection</a></button>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
